@host = http://localhost:5008
@keyboard = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@mouse = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@monitor = 33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333
@customer = aaaaaaaa-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### [Catalog] Ürünleri ve stoğu listele
GET {{host}}/products

### [Ordering] Sipariş ver → Catalog'a SENKRON fiyat sorgusu + outbox'a OrderPlaced
# @name placeOrder
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customer}}",
  "items": [
    { "productId": "{{keyboard}}", "quantity": 2 },
    { "productId": "{{mouse}}", "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Oluşan siparişin id'si
@orderId = {{placeOrder.response.body.$.id}}

### [Ordering] Siparişi getir
GET {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### [Ordering] Tüm siparişler
GET {{host}}/orders

### [Shipping] Siparişin kargo kaydı (ASENKRON oluşur; ~1 sn sonra 200 döner)
GET {{host}}/shipments/by-order/{{orderId}}

### [Shipping] Tüm kargolar
GET {{host}}/shipments

### [Catalog] Stok ASENKRON düştü mü? (Klavye 10→8, Mouse 20→19)
GET {{host}}/products

### [Ordering] Kargola → 204 (Shipping, OrderShipped ile kargoyu "Shipped" yapar)
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}/ship

### [Ordering] Kargolanmış siparişi iptal etmeyi dene → 409
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel

### Yeni sipariş (iptal senaryosu için)
# @name placeOrder2
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customer}}",
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{monitor}}", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

###
@orderId2 = {{placeOrder2.response.body.$.id}}

### [Ordering] İptal → 204 (Catalog stoğu iade eder, Shipping kargoyu iptal eder)
POST {{host}}/orders/{{orderId2}}/cancel

### Bilinmeyen ürün → 400
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customer}}",
  "items": [ { "productId": "99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999", "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### Stok yetersiz (senkron ön kontrol) → 409
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customer}}",
  "items": [ { "productId": "{{monitor}}", "quantity": 50 } ]
}

### Olmayan sipariş → 404
GET {{host}}/orders/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
